se: ${productName} held up close to camera. All angles visible. Key features highlighted with hand gestures. Dynamic presentation style.`,\n        visualPromptCN: `产品展示：${productName}近距离展示。所有角度可见。用手势突出关键特性。动态演示风格。`,\n        cameraMovement: CAMERA_MOVEMENTS.handheld,\n        cameraAngle: 'close-up',\n        cameraDistance: CAMERA_DISTANCE.closeUp,\n        subject: `${productName} showcase`,\n        action: 'dynamic product presentation',\n        environment: 'streaming background',\n        lighting: LIGHTING_OPTIONS.bright,\n        mood: 'excited, promotional',\n        colorTone: 'bright, product-accurate',\n        transition: 'cut',\n        voiceover: language.startsWith('zh') ? `${sellingPoints[0] || '看这个品质'}` : `${sellingPoints[0] || 'Check this quality'}`,\n        musicSuggestion: 'upbeat promotional music',\n        startTime: baseDuration,\n        endTime: baseDuration * 2,\n      });\n      \n      scenes.push({\n        order: 3,\n        duration: baseDuration,\n        visualPrompt: `Feature highlight: Close-up of ${productName} key feature. ${sellingPoints[1] || 'Premium quality'} demonstration. Pointer or hand highlighting specific benefit.`,\n        visualPromptCN: `特性突出：${productName}关键特性特写。${sellingPoints[1] || '高端品质'}演示。指针或手突出特定优势。`,\n        cameraMovement: CAMERA_MOVEMENTS.zoom,\n        cameraAngle: 'extreme close-up',\n        cameraDistance: CAMERA_DISTANCE.extremeCloseUp,\n        subject: `${productName} key feature`,\n        action: 'feature demonstration',\n        environment: 'clean backdrop',\n        lighting: LIGHTING_OPTIONS.studio,\n        mood: 'informative, persuasive',\n        colorTone: 'clear, focused',\n        transition: 'cut',\n        voiceover: language.startsWith('zh') ? `${sellingPoints[1] || '而且还有这个'}` : `${sellingPoints[1] || 'And check this out'}`,\n        musicSuggestion: 'feature highlight music',\n        startTime: baseDuration * 2,\n        endTime: baseDuration * 3,\n      });\n\n      if (sceneCount >= 5) {\n        scenes.push({\n          order: 4,\n          duration: baseDuration,\n          visualPrompt: `Price reveal and value proposition. ${productName} with price overlay space. Special offer visual. Urgency creation with countdown timer space.`,\n          visualPromptCN: `价格揭晓和价值主张。${productName}配价格覆盖空间。特别优惠视觉效果。倒计时空间营造紧迫感。`,\n          cameraMovement: CAMERA_MOVEMENTS.pushIn,\n          cameraAngle: 'medium shot',\n          cameraDistance: CAMERA_DISTANCE.medium,\n          subject: `${productName} with offer`,\n          action: 'price and offer reveal',\n          environment: 'promotional graphics space',\n          lighting: LIGHTING_OPTIONS.bright,\n          mood: 'urgent, exciting',\n          colorTone: 'sale colors, red accents',\n          transition: 'cut',\n          voiceover: language.startsWith('zh') ? `限时特惠，手慢无！` : `Limited time offer, act fast!`,\n          musicSuggestion: 'urgent promotional music',\n          startTime: baseDuration * 3,\n          endTime: baseDuration * 4,\n        });\n        \n        scenes.push({\n          order: 5,\n          duration: baseDuration,\n          visualPrompt: `Call to action finale: ${productName} center frame with clear purchase CTA. Link in bio/description visual. Professional close with brand moment.`,\n          visualPromptCN: `行动号召结局：${productName}居中配清晰购买CTA。简介/描述链接视觉效果。专业结尾配品牌时刻。`,\n          cameraMovement: CAMERA_MOVEMENTS.static,\n          cameraAngle: 'medium shot',\n          cameraDistance: CAMERA_DISTANCE.medium,\n          subject: `${productName} CTA shot`,\n          action: 'final call to action',\n          environment: 'branded conclusion',\n          lighting: LIGHTING_OPTIONS.studio,\n          mood: 'conclusive, actionable',\n          colorTone: 'brand colors',\n          transition: 'fade',\n          voiceover: language.startsWith('zh') ? `${productName}，点击下方链接购买！` : `${productName}, click the link below to buy!`,\n          musicSuggestion: 'energetic closing music',\n          startTime: baseDuration * 4,\n          endTime: baseDuration * 5,\n        });\n      }\n      break;\n  }\n\n  return scenes;\n}\n\n// 生成脚本内容\nfunction generateScriptContent(\n  style: UGCStyle,\n  productName: string,\n  category: string,\n  sellingPoints: string[],\n  duration: number,\n  language: Language\n): string {\n  const styleTemplate = VIDEO_STYLE_TEMPLATES[style];\n  \n  return `# AI视频生成脚本 - ${styleTemplate.name}\n\n## 基本信息\n- **产品名称**: ${productName}\n- **产品类目**: ${category}\n- **核心卖点**: ${sellingPoints.join('、')}\n- **视频时长**: ${duration}秒\n- **视频风格**: ${styleTemplate.description}\n- **目标语言**: ${language}\n\n## 视觉风格指引\n- **镜头风格**: ${styleTemplate.cameraStyle}\n- **光线风格**: ${styleTemplate.lightingStyle}\n- **情绪氛围**: ${styleTemplate.mood}\n\n---\n## 分镜脚本（AI视频生成模型专用）\n\n以下分镜格式专为 Veo3.1、即梦、可灵、Runway Gen-3、Pika、Sora 等AI视频生成模型优化。\n\n每个分镜包含：\n1. **Visual Prompt** - 英文画面描述（直接复制给AI模型）\n2. **镜头语言** - 运镜、角度、景别\n3. **画面元素** - 主体、动作、环境、光线、色调\n4. **转场效果** - 剪辑节奏\n5. **音频建议** - 口播文案、背景音乐\n\n---\n`;\n}\n\n// 生成口播文案\nfunction generateVoiceover(\n  style: UGCStyle,\n  productName: string,\n  category: string,\n  sellingPoints: string[],\n  language: Language\n): string {\n  const langMap: Record<string, { prefix: string; suffix: string }> = {\n    'zh-CN': { prefix: '姐妹们！今天给大家分享', suffix: '记得点赞收藏，链接在评论区！' },\n    'zh-TW': { prefix: '姐妹們！今天跟大家分享', suffix: '記得按讚收藏，連結在評論區！' },\n    'en-US': { prefix: \"Hey everyone! Today I'm sharing\", suffix: \"Don't forget to like and save! Link in description!\" },\n  };\n  \n  const lang = langMap[language] || langMap['zh-CN'];\n  \n  return `【口播文案】\n\n${lang.prefix}${category}好物——${productName}！\n\n${sellingPoints.map((sp, i) => `${i + 1}. ${sp}`).join('\\n')}\n\n${lang.suffix}\n`;\n}\n\n// 音乐推荐\nfunction getMusicRecommendation(style: UGCStyle): string {\n  const recommendations: Record<UGCStyle, string> = {\n    unboxing: '推荐：轻快节奏音乐，开箱惊喜感，适合ASMR风格的轻柔音效',\n    usage: '推荐：自然舒适背景音乐，生活化氛围，轻松惬意的节奏',\n    comparison: '推荐：中性专业背景音乐，客观分析感，不过于花哨',\n    story: '推荐：情感音乐，随故事起伏，有叙事感的配乐',\n    voiceover: '推荐：动感节奏音乐，直播带货风格，激励购买欲望',\n  };\n  \n  return recommendations[style];\n}\n\n// 生成脚本接口\nrouter.post('/script', async (req: Request, res: Response) => {\n  try {\n    const data = GenerateScriptSchema.parse(req.body);\n    \n    // 生成AI视频分镜\n    const scenes = generateVideoScenes(\n      data.style,\n      data.productName,\n      data.category,\n      data.sellingPoints,\n      data.duration,\n      data.referenceImages || [],\n      data.language || 'zh-CN'\n    );\n    \n    // 生成脚本内容\n    const scriptContent = generateScriptContent(\n      data.style,\n      data.productName,\n      data.category,\n      data.sellingPoints,\n      data.duration,\n      data.language || 'zh-CN'\n    );\n    \n    // 生成口播文案\n    const voiceover = generateVoiceover(\n      data.style,\n      data.productName,\n      data.category,\n      data.sellingPoints,\n      data.language || 'zh-CN'\n    );\n    \n    // 音乐推荐\n    const musicStyle = getMusicRecommendation(data.style);\n    \n    // 保存到数据库\n    const project = await prisma.project.update({\n      where: { id: data.projectId },\n      data: {\n        scriptContent,\n        voiceover,\n        musicStyle,\n        status: 'completed',\n        language: data.language || 'zh-CN',\n        aspectRatio: data.aspectRatio || '9:16',\n        referenceImages: data.referenceImages || [],\n        scenes: {\n          deleteMany: {},\n          create: scenes.map(scene => ({\n            order: scene.order,\n            duration: scene.duration,\n            description: scene.visualPromptCN,\n            voiceover: scene.voiceover,\n            cameraAngle: `${scene.cameraMovement}, ${scene.cameraAngle}`,\n            notes: JSON.stringify({\n              visualPrompt: scene.visualPrompt,\n              cameraDistance: scene.cameraDistance,\n              subject: scene.subject,\n              action: scene.action,\n              environment: scene.environment,\n              lighting: scene.lighting,\n              mood: scene.mood,\n              colorTone: scene.colorTone,\n              transition: scene.transition,\n              musicSuggestion: scene.musicSuggestion,\n              startTime: scene.startTime,\n              endTime: scene.endTime,\n            }),\n          })),\n        },\n      },\n      include: {\n        product: true,\n        scenes: { orderBy: { order: 'asc' } },\n      },\n    });\n\n    res.json({\n      success: true,\n      data: {\n        project,\n        script: scriptContent,\n        scenes,\n        voiceover,\n        musicStyle,\n      },\n    });\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: error.errors });\n    } else {\n      console.error('Generate script error:', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: 'Failed to generate script' });\n    }\n  }\n});\n\nexport default router;\n","file_path":"/workspace/backend/src/modules/generate.ts"},"tool_response":"Successfully overwrote file: /workspace/backend/src/modules/generate.ts","client":"CLI","version":"2.90.0","generation_id":"0581a5b4927d4ac4b565d279a480a8e1","model":"glm-5.0","call_id":"call_3ce4f9a32e8440678c3f534d"}
